<title>USA: Eastern Co names Leganza temporary CEO.</title>
<headline>Eastern Co names Leganza temporary CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NAUGATUCK, Conn. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Co said Wednesday that Stedman Sweet, chief executive officer and president, has retired from the company ahead of schedule in order to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The company said he will be succeeded by Leonard Leganza, a director of the company and former chief financial officer of privately held Scovill Manufacturing Co, while Eastern's directors seek a permanent replacement.</p>
